Server init.

>> x := Blob tuntun: 65 oriṣi: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Eto eto: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server sopọ: (
 Akojọ tuntun ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Akojọ tuntun ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x lati: 0 gigun: 1), ila-tuntun.
x tu-silẹ.

